---
/**
 * Sydney block — the brand's soul. Two-column narrative + key meta.
 */
---

<section class="sydney">
  <div class="sydney-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sydney-grid">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">Sydney, end to end</div>
        <h2>
          Built here.
          <br />
          <span class="gold">Answered here.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="sydney-body">
          Every line of Biteperk code is written, deployed and supported from Sydney. Our
          servers live in Australian data centres, the phone numbers are Australian, and the
          voice that greets your guests sounds like one of them. We're an AI company that
          behaves like a neighbourhood business — because the restaurants we serve are
          neighbourhood businesses too.
        </p>
        <div class="sydney-meta">
          <div>
            <div class="meta-n">100%</div>
            <div class="meta-l">made in Sydney</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="meta-n">AU</div>
            <div class="meta-l">data residency</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="meta-n">9 am – 9 pm</div>
            <div class="meta-l">human support, AEST</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="sydney-card">
          <div class="sydney-card-title">Why this matters for restaurants</div>
          <p class="sydney-card-text">
            AI built for a different market tends to feel that way. Bella was trained on
            Australian English from the start, knows what BYO means, doesn't ask for a zip
            code, and gets "tomorrow night, eight o'clock for four" without three rounds of
            confirmation.
          </p>
          <div class="sydney-card-list">
            <div class="sydney-card-list-item">Natural AU accent, not localised offshore</div>
            <div class="sydney-card-list-item">Sydney suburbs spelt and pronounced right</div>
            <div class="sydney-card-list-item">Privacy Act compliant, hosted in AU</div>
            <div class="sydney-card-list-item">Direct phone support during service hours</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .sydney {
    padding-block: var(--space-section);
    position: relative;
    background: var(--ink-0);
    overflow: hidden;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .sydney-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: radial-gradient(50% 60% at 50% 40%, rgba(26, 77, 26, 0.32), transparent 70%);
  }
  .sydney .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .sydney-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 72px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .sydney h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: var(--lh-display);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: var(--white);
  }
  .sydney h2 .gold { color: var(--gold); }
  .sydney-body {
    margin-top: 28px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .sydney-meta {
    margin-top: 38px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
    gap: 22px;
  }
  .meta-n {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .meta-l {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mist);
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .sydney-card {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    padding: 48px 40px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(26, 77, 26, 0.16), var(--ink-1) 70%);
    box-shadow:
      0 24px 60px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }
  .sydney-card-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .sydney-card-text {
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: var(--mist-2);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .sydney-card-list {
    margin-top: 22px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .sydney-card-list-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 14.5px;
  }
  .sydney-card-list-item::before {
    content: "";
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
    flex: 0 0 5px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .sydney-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 56px; }
    .sydney-card { padding: 36px 28px; }
  }
</style>
